<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva airport cargo, passengers down in July.</title>
<headline>Geneva airport cargo, passengers down in July.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Geneva's Cointrin airport saw a drop in freight and passenger traffic in July, according to figures issued on Monday.</p>
<p>The Geneva cantonal statistical office OCSTAT said the airport, which serves as both a national and an international hub, moved 5,253 tonnes of freight during the month, 5.6 per cent less than in July 1995.</p>
<p>OCSTAT said 568,400 passengers passed through Cointrin, 1.4 per cent less than in the same month last year.</p>
</text>
